Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; Brings back the full (classic) right-click menu on Windows 11 for this user.
; An empty InprocServer32 value turns off the new compact menu.
; Restart Windows Explorer (Task Manager > Windows Explorer > Restart) afterwards.

[HKEY_CURRENT_USER\Software\Classes\CLSID\{86ca1aa0-34aa-4e8b-a509-50c905bae2a2}\InprocServer32]
